Unificado de Los Ángeles.

539
00:34:03,585 --> 00:34:05,629
Señoras y señores, Miss Pasadena.

540
00:34:05,712 --> 00:34:09,591
Desde el corazón de Burbank,
tenemos a Mary.

541
00:34:09,674 --> 00:34:11,551
Mary es Miss Burbank

542
00:34:11,635 --> 00:34:15,347
