601
00:38:00,447 --> 00:38:01,573
Venga.

602
00:38:03,700 --> 00:38:05,660
¡Venga, sal!

603
00:38:07,162 --> 00:38:09,289
¿A qué esperas? Espabila.

604
00:38:09,873 --> 00:38:11,625
¡Gary, espabila!

605
00:38:18,673 --> 00:38:19,758
Venga.

606
00:38:43,698 --> 00:38:44,908
¿Qué has hecho?

607
00:38:46,660 --> 00:38:48,328
¿Te has cargado a alguien?

608
00:38:48,995 --> 00:38:50,539
¿Llevas droga encima?

609
00:38:51,289 --> 00:38:52,791
¿Qué has hecho?

610
00:39:30,036 --> 00:39:31,454
