745
00:46:34,669 --> 00:46:35,754
- Más sexy...
- Voy...

746
00:46:35,837 --> 00:46:37,131
- ...o no compra.
- ...a pensarlo

747
00:46:37,214 --> 00:46:38,173
y te llamo.

748
00:46:38,256 --> 00:46:39,466
Que no cuelgue.

749
00:46:39,549 --> 00:46:40,634
¿Cómo te llamas?

750
00:46:41,009 --> 00:46:41,968
Ted.

751
00:46:42,802 --> 00:46:43,845
